* Mon Oct 19 2026 fravaccaro 0.6.0-9
- Restarting the phone no longer asks for the API token again: the token lives
  in a device-lock collection of the encrypted storage, and reading it may ask
  the system to unlock that collection, which a restart locks again
- A token that could not be read keeps the app waiting, with what the secure
  storage said and a way to try again, instead of showing the sign-in page as
  though the token were gone
- Tokens written by earlier versions move into the new collection on the first
  start that can read them

* Sat Oct 17 2026 fravaccaro 0.6.0-8
- Documents can be downloaded into Downloads/Paperiton from a row's context
  menu, or in bulk from the pulley menu when two or more are selected
- A download is followed by a progress notification, then one events-view entry
  per file with Open and Share
- Picking documents out of the list is asked for from the pulley menu, and a
  long press no longer opens an empty menu that left the pulley unanswering
- Open writes the file to Downloads/Paperiton under the name the server keeps
  for it and hands PDFs to the system viewer; Save on device is gone
- Choosing a tag or a correspondent replaces the previous place to look,
  instead of combining with it
- New icon assets

* Sat Sep 05 2026 fravaccaro 0.5.6-1
- Signing in with the web interface works: the token is taken from the account
  profile instead of a script whose answer never came back
- The API token and the web interface are two separate choices on the sign-in
  page, each showing only what it needs, instead of the web interface hiding
  behind the token option

* Sat Sep 05 2026 fravaccaro 0.5.5-1
- Documents can be deleted
- Redesign sign-in page
- "Clear all filters" is greyed out when there is nothing to clear

* Sat Sep 05 2026 fravaccaro 0.5.4-1
- Cover action for uploads.

* Sat Sep 05 2026 fravaccaro 0.5.3-1
- The search field is asked for from the pulley menu instead of standing above
  the documents all the time, and hiding it calls the search off

* Sat Sep 05 2026 fravaccaro 0.5.2-1
- The whole app now works on one list of documents, and the cover reads the
  number of documents in the inbox from the tag itself rather than by listing
  the inbox on the side

* Wed Sep 02 2026 fravaccaro 0.5.1-1
- Only files Paperless can take are offered: the picker lists PDFs, pictures
  and plain text files, other apps offer Paperiton for those kinds only, and a
  file of another kind is turned down with the reason instead of being sent
- An upload is followed by a notification with a progress bar and ends as one
  summary, instead of a message per file
- About page

* Tue Sep 01 2026 fravaccaro 0.5-1
- Sign in through the web interface, so that single sign-on and two-factor
  authentication work; the API token is kept in Sailfish Secrets
- Upload files from the device, from other apps and from the camera, and
  follow the consumer task until the document exists
- Edit title, correspondent, type, tags, date, archive serial number and
  custom fields, and change several documents at once
- Notes, saved views, inbox and the task queue of the server

* Tue Sep 01 2026 fravaccaro 0.1-1
- Initial release: token login, document browsing, search, tag and
  correspondent filters, thumbnails, OCR text and previews
